(text "Address bus A0-A19 and data bus D0-D7 come from Fig 1 (latches and buffers); /RD, /WR and IO/M from its 74LS245.\nMemory decode (Fig 2): A17-A19 -> RAM 00000H (Y0), red LED 20000H (Y1), green LED 40000H (Y2), EEPROM E0000H (Y7).\nI/O decode (Fig 4): A4-A6 -> PPI 00H (Y0), PIT 40H (Y4), PIC 50H (Y5)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 149.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "494a4ead-f81b-42ff-ad8b-8763adc96aa2"))
(text "IC power is implied, not drawn (as on the 2007 figures):\n  8088: VCC 40, GND 1 20        8284A: VCC 18, GND 9\n  8255: VCC 26, GND 7           8253: VCC 24, GND 12\n  8259A: VCC 28, GND 14         6264: VCC 28, GND 14\n  29010: VCC 32 (drawn), GND 16 74LS373 / 74LS245: VCC 20, GND 10\n  74LS138 / 74LS47: VCC 16, GND 8   75452: VCC 8, GND 4 (drawn)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 166.37 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "2ec060d5-eaa4-4eae-b493-56b5941f1c95"))

